# A local Gemini response with an unrenderable MIME type becomes an arrival:
# exact bytes enter the session representation store, a collision-safe visible
# copy lands in the configured download directory, and Gloss projects the
# durable custody record.
settle 30
key escape
open gemini://127.0.0.1:19653/archive.bin
settle 60
assert event download-started gemini://127.0.0.1:19653/archive.bin bytes=13
assert event download-completed
act Open Gloss pane
settle 10
assert pane gloss
assert surface pane
assert text archive.bin - completed - 13 bytes
capture 01_download_gloss
log smolweb download custody receipt complete
